OL,3,GNEWSAI thought I was going to die after
OL,4,Aplane cockpit windscreen cracked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger on a flight from London to
OL,7,FLondonderry has said she thought she
OL,8,Fwas going to die after a mid-air
OL,9,Femergency was declared.
OL,11,FJoanne McLaughlin said they were told
OL,12,Fto prepare for the brace position while
OL,13,Fcrossing the Irish Sea, and the "plane
OL,14,Fwas definitely descending".
OL,16,F"When the first announcement was made,
OL,17,FI 100% thought I was going to die, it
OL,18,Fwas absolutely terrifying," McLaughlin
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
