OL,3,GNEWSAI thought I was going to die after
OL,4,Aplane cockpit windscreen cracked
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was travelling on a Loganair flight
OL,7,Ffrom London Heathrow to the City of
OL,8,FDerry airport on Thursday. It later
OL,9,Femerged a cockpit windscreen had
OL,10,Fcracked. The Scottish airline said
OL,11,Fsafety protocols had been followed.
